stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> New : User sends first message

    state New {
        [*] --> CheckDefaultRepo
        CheckDefaultRepo --> HasDefaultRepo : org has default_github_repo
        CheckDefaultRepo --> NoDefaultRepo : no default repo
    }

    NoDefaultRepo --> AwaitingRepo : Bot asks "which repo?\nReply with owner/name"
    HasDefaultRepo --> AgentRunning : runFreshAgent()

    AwaitingRepo --> AgentRunning : User replies "owner/name"\nparsed successfully
    AwaitingRepo --> AwaitingRepo : Parse failed\nBot nudges user to retry

    AgentRunning --> SandboxFailed : Daytona create fails\nor agent crashes
    AgentRunning --> PRCreated : Claude posts PR URL\nsandbox archived

    SandboxFailed --> AgentRunning : User sends any message\norphan sandbox archived\nnew sandbox spun up

    PRCreated --> FollowUpRunning : User sends follow-up\nmessage in thread
    FollowUpRunning --> PRCreated : Follow-up complete\nnew commit pushed\nsandbox archived

    FollowUpRunning --> FollowUpFailed : Agent crashes
    FollowUpFailed --> FollowUpRunning : User retries

    PRCreated --> [*] : Conversation abandoned
    SandboxFailed --> [*] : Conversation abandoned

    note right of AwaitingRepo
        Stored state:
        History[0] = original request
        GitHubOwner = ""
        SandboxID = ""
    end note

    note right of SandboxFailed
        Stored state:
        SandboxID set (if agent started)
        PRURL = "" (distinguishes from PRCreated)
        Next message triggers archive + retry
    end note

    note right of PRCreated
        Stored state:
        SandboxID, Branch, PRURL all set
        Sandbox is ARCHIVED (cost-efficient)
        Follow-up resumes from archive
    end note
